			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751330301,
					"content": "#哇，打開了，這次多虧了{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}才找到機關了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330302,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330303,
					"content": "#不愧是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751330304,
					"content": "不過也不要自滿哦，接下來還有更多的挑戰在等著我們呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330305,
					"content": "既然入口已經打開了，不管怎麼樣我們都必須下去探個究竟了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330306,
					"content": "我也同意哦，小派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330307,
					"content": "嘰…嘰！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330308,
					"content": "嗯？綠寶你怎麼這麼抗拒的樣子啦，不會是害怕了吧？千萬不能在這裡退縮啊，我們的冒險之旅才剛走到一半耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330309,
					"content": "咕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330310,
					"content": "玻娜妳就不要強迫綠寶了啦，牠看起來真的很害怕的樣子，難不成是下面有什麼不得了的危險東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330311,
					"content": "好可怕！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751330312,
					"content": "#喂，{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼也開始害怕了？像{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}一樣打起精神來啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330313,
					"content": "開始躍躍欲試了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330314
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751330314,
					"content": "#哇，沒想到{F#妳}{M#你}這麼有精神，雖然我也覺得不管下面有什麼都不會是{F#妳}{M#你}的對手啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751330315,
					"content": "不用擔心，我們有勇敢小龍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751330316
					]
				},
